                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUR BESTIMMUNG DER IMPEDANZEIGENSCHAFTEN EINER LAST UNTER VERWENDUNG VON LASTANALYSESIGNALEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME ET PROCÉDÉ POUR DÉTERMINER LES PROPRIÉTÉS D'IMPÉDANCE D'UNE CHARGE À L'AIDE DE SIGNAUX D'ANALYSE DE CHARGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR DETERMINING THE IMPEDANCE PROPERTIES OF A LOAD USING LOAD ANALYSIS SIGNALS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Various embodiments are described herein for measuring the impedance properties of a load using load analysis signals. In one example embodiment, a transformer is provided which includes at least one primary winding, and at least one secondary winding. The at least one primary winding is coupled in series between a direct-current (DC) power supply and the load. A variable alternating-current (AC) voltage generator is coupled in-series to the at least one secondary winding, and is configured generate at least one load analysis signal for injection into the load. The impedance properties of the load may be determined for different frequencies in the load analysis signals.</p>
            </abstract>
